---
// PRD §10, TRD §5: Protocol & Tool Catalogue Reference — Light Ribbon theme, AC-P14-07
import '../styles/theme.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <title>Protocol Reference — Tether</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
    h2 {
      color: var(--t-text-900);
      margin-top: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--t-line);
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    p, li {
      color: var(--t-text-700);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
      background: var(--t-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--t-line);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    .tool-name {
      font-family: var(--t-font-mono);
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--t-text-900);
    }
    .tier-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .tier-t0 { background: var(--t-teal-tint); color: var(--t-teal-fg); }
    .tier-t1 { background: var(--t-blue-tint); color: var(--t-blue-fg); }
    .tier-t2 { background: var(--t-amber-tint); color: var(--t-amber-fg); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Protocol &amp; Tool Catalogue Reference</h1>
    <p>Tether exposes 40 frozen tools divided into two profiles: <code>browser-readonly</code> and <code>browser-act</code>.</p>

    <h2>Readonly Tools (Tier 0)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_snapshot</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t0">T0</span> — Captures accessibility tree snapshot with stable element refs.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_screenshot</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t0">T0</span> — Captures viewport screenshot with sensitive node redaction.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_tabs</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t0">T0</span> — Lists open browser tabs in active window.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_get_text</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t0">T0</span> — Retrieves text content from element by ref.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Action Tools (Tier 1 &amp; Tier 2)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_click</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t1">T1</span> — Dispatches trusted click events to target element.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_type</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t1">T1</span> — Types characters sequentially with synthetic key events.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_submit</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t2">T2</span> — Submits forms or triggers high-risk state changes (requires diff confirmation).</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">browser_navigate</span><span class="tier-badge tier-t1">T1</span> — Navigates current tab to URL.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Governance &amp; Security Tools</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><span class="tool-name">policy_check</span> — Queries authorization policy engine for an action.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">audit_verify</span> — Verifies cryptographic integrity of the audit hash chain.</li>
      <li><span class="tool-name">session_kill</span> — Engages emergency kill switch (&le; 200ms).</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
